{"id":51319,"date":"2026-05-22T02:34:05","date_gmt":"2026-05-22T01:34:05","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=51319"},"modified":"2026-09-04T09:12:12","modified_gmt":"2026-09-04T08:12:12","slug":"bimbo-global-race","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/bimbo-global-race\/","title":{"rendered":"Bimbo Global Race 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Bimbo Global Race 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A <strong>11\u00aa Bimbo Global Race 2026<\/strong> regressa a <strong>Lisboa<\/strong> no dia <strong>27 de setembro de 2026<\/strong>, consolidando-se como uma das maiores provas solid\u00e1rias e comunit\u00e1rias do mundo. Tendo como cen\u00e1rio de partida e meta a imponente <strong>Pra\u00e7a do Imp\u00e9rio<\/strong>, em <strong>Bel\u00e9m<\/strong>, a iniciativa promovida pelo <strong>Grupo Bimbo<\/strong> e com organiza\u00e7\u00e3o t\u00e9cnica da <strong>Xistarca<\/strong> re\u00fane atletas experientes, praticantes recreativos e fam\u00edlias numa celebra\u00e7\u00e3o vibrante do desporto, convertendo cada participante inscrito em doa\u00e7\u00f5es de fatias de p\u00e3o para apoiar bancos alimentares e fam\u00edlias vulner\u00e1veis.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">O percurso \u00e9 integralmente plano e desenhado na frente ribeirinha da capital, percorrendo as emblem\u00e1ticas <strong>Avenida da \u00cdndia<\/strong> e <strong>Avenida 24 de Julho<\/strong>, oferecendo as condi\u00e7\u00f5es ideais para obten\u00e7\u00e3o de recordes pessoais na competitiva <strong>Corrida de 10 km<\/strong> (com pr\u00e9mio extraordin\u00e1rio de viagem e alojamento aos vencedores para a edi\u00e7\u00e3o de 2027), complementada pela <strong>Mini-Corrida de 5 km<\/strong>, <strong>Caminhada de 5 km<\/strong> e as divertidas provas <strong>Kids Race<\/strong> (200m, 400m e 800m). O evento conta com cronometragem por chip eletr\u00f3nico, abastecimentos de \u00e1gua aos 5 km e meta, kit oficial com t-shirt t\u00e9cnica e seguro desportivo para todos os inscritos.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-t