>At\u00e9 21 de Setembro:<\/strong> 14.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (21\/09\/2026)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">At\u00e9 23 de Setembro:<\/strong> 17.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (23\/09\/2026)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">\u00daltima Hora (Presencial):<\/strong> 10.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (25 a 27\/09\/2026)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Corrida Kids<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Kids Race (200m a 800m)<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 27 Set \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 08:50<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">At\u00e9 30 de Junho:<\/strong> 5.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (30\/06\/2026)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">At\u00e9 07 de Setembro:<\/strong> 6.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (07\/09\/2026)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">At\u00e9 21 de Setembro:<\/strong> 7.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (21\/09\/2026)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">At\u00e9 23 de Setembro:<\/strong> 8.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (23\/09\/2026)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">\u00daltima Hora (Presencial):<\/strong> 10.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (25 a 27\/09\/2026)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 a data e o local de partida da Bimbo Global Race 2026?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A 11\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o da Bimbo Global Race realiza-se no domingo, 27 de setembro de 2026, com partidas e chegadas instaladas na Pra\u00e7a do Imp\u00e9rio, em Bel\u00e9m, Lisboa.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias e os hor\u00e1rios de partida das provas?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O programa inicia-se com as provas Kids Race \u00e0s 08h50 (200m para at\u00e9 6 anos, 400m \u00e0s 09h00 para 7-9 anos e 800m \u00e0s 09h10 para 10-12 anos), seguindo-se a Corrida de 10 km \u00e0s 09h45, a Mini-Corrida de 5 km \u00e0s 09h55 e a Caminhada de 5 km \u00e0s 10h00.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Como funciona a tabela de pre\u00e7os e as fases de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es variam por fase de calend\u00e1rio. Na fase atual (at\u00e9 07 de setembro), os valores s\u00e3o de 14,00 \u20ac para os 10 km, 12,00 \u20ac para a Mini-Corrida de 5 km, 11,00 \u20ac para a Caminhada e 6,00 \u20ac para a Kids Race. As fases seguintes aumentam at\u00e9 ao fecho online a 23 de setembro, com inscri\u00e7\u00f5es de \u00faltima hora presenciais nos dias de levantamento de dorsais.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde e quando \u00e9 realizado o levantamento do kit de participante?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A entrega de dorsais e kits decorre na Decathlon Amadora na sexta-feira, 25 de setembro (10h00 \u00e0s 20h00) e s\u00e1bado, 26 de setembro (10h00 \u00e0s 17h00). No dia da prova (27 de setembro), o levantamento na Pra\u00e7a do Imp\u00e9rio funciona entre as 07h45 e as 08h45 com taxa de servi\u00e7o associada.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 o cariz solid\u00e1rio da Bimbo Global Race e que pr\u00e9mios existem?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Por cada participante inscrito, o Grupo Bimbo doa fatias de p\u00e3o a institui\u00e7\u00f5es de solidariedade social locais. Em termos desportivos, h\u00e1 trof\u00e9us para os primeiros da geral e escal\u00f5es nos 10 km e 5 km, al\u00e9m do pr\u00e9mio especial aos vencedores absolutos masculinos e femininos dos 10 km de uma viagem completa para competir na Bimbo Global Race 2027.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<p><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Bimbo Global Race 2026\", \"startDate\": \"2026-09-27\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Pra\u00e7a do Imp\u00e9rio, Bel\u00e9m\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Lisboa\", \"addressRegion\": \"Lisboa\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"organizer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Grupo Bimbo e Xistarca\"}}<\/script><script t