vi\u00e7o associada.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Qual \u00e9 o cariz solid\u00e1rio da Bimbo Global Race e que pr\u00e9mios existem?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Por cada participante inscrito, o Grupo Bimbo doa fatias de p\u00e3o a institui\u00e7\u00f5es de solidariedade social locais. Em termos desportivos, h\u00e1 trof\u00e9us para os primeiros da geral e escal\u00f5es nos 10 km e 5 km, al\u00e9m do pr\u00e9mio especial aos vencedores absolutos masculinos e femininos dos 10 km de uma viagem completa para competir na Bimbo Global Race 2027.\"}}]}<\/script><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":66703,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[672,27,28,478,624],"event_type_2":[33,727,820],"event_type_3":[],"event_type_4":[811],"event_type_5":[],"class_list":["post-51319","ajde_events","type-ajde_events","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","event_location-lisboa","event_type-caminhada","event_type-corrida","event_type-corrida-10-km","event_type-corridas-inferior-10","event_type-kids","event_type_2-lisboa","event_type_2-lisboa-e-centro","event_type_2-portugal","event_type_4-solidaria-sim"],"acf":[],"featured_image_src":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/bimbo-global-race-1.webp","ams_acf":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/51319","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/ajde_events"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=51319"}],"version-history":[{"count":5,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.c